<xml xmlns="https://developers.google.com/blockly/xml"><variables><variable id="=%:P4jbHx}sseKbRENAd">stato</variable></variables><comment id="0[o5@_!,HBmX.dy$I{]7" x="530.7470592078796" y="0.9262629353559912" w="480" h="120">
Codifica stati: 0 = Bloccato, 1 = Attesa B (dopo aver premuto A), 2 = Sbloccato
</comment><comment id="L4H)W~$n*h{#Rk1qi2dn" x="12.96773197597129" y="-2.7787697256976855" w="480" h="280">
Costruisci una Cassaforte Digitale.

- La cassaforte si sblocca (mostrando l'icona Yes) se e solo se l'utente inserisce la combinazione ordinata A seguita da B.

- Qualsiasi pressione errata (es. premere B come prima scelta) mantiene il sistema bloccato.

- Una volta aperta, la cassaforte può essere bloccata premendo A+B.
</comment><block type="pxt-on-start" id=":B_paH|.n2aJO=+bZO5v" x="532" y="133"><statement name="HANDLER"><block type="basic_show_icon" id="uNMWc.E~#^g$tXk=vp2$"><field name="i">IconNames.No</field><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="160">Lucchetto chiuso</comment></block></statement></block><block type="device_button_event" id="tvVf1~J7a?R09DK4`5hm" x="831" y="137"><field name="NAME">Button.AB</field><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="160">Comando di reset/chiusura universale</comment><data>0</data><statement name="HANDLER"><block type="variables_set" id="N,~{7O@PE(8!Azv[fpW~"><field name="VAR" id="=%:P4jbHx}sseKbRENAd">stato</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="yaYrb9fs%HlXnyna=)4|"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="basic_show_icon" id="8mY{(a}=[Z5C_l6#]8s#"><field name="i">IconNames.No</field><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="160">Cassaforte bloccata</comment></block></next></block></statement></block><block type="device_button_event" id="]6|mn-[ncDP-GP0[UYn*" x="15" y="287"><field name="NAME">Button.A</field><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="160">Lucchetto chiuso</comment><statement name="HANDLER"><block type="controls_if" id="uIbusGZ?JBUyj/:9gkn="><mutation elseif="1"></mutation><value name="IF0"><shadow type="logic_boolean" id="u$vIny!ay{+`vRk[bCEV"><field name="BOOL">TRUE</field></shadow><block type="logic_compare" id="9Mi!siac1A$5ei@%B2Y)"><field name="OP">EQ</field><value name="A"><shadow type="math_number" id="7R#uxbG@{po5q5Y^LzJ0"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="variables_get" id="/y|TctP~hR}HjXam/W?+"><field name="VAR" id="=%:P4jbHx}sseKbRENAd">stato</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="_8E/9qx]i0|ktfh@G0I0"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="variables_set" id="vbkD)Y76}pz;w5MpYv7}"><field name="VAR" id="=%:P4jbHx}sseKbRENAd">stato</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="M4^oCqL6KLuJ